## Hints for Future Agents
Skill directory name and the frontmatter `name:` must agree; editing only the
frontmatter leaves the skill invocable under the old path-derived name. Version
bumps for this plugin live only in .claude-plugin/plugin.json, and
plugins/abatilo-core/CLAUDE.md makes bumping mandatory for any change under
commands/, skills/, hooks/, or .claude-plugin/.

